    Assets:Cash

test xact 2024/03/01 Zebra Food 7
2024/03/01 Zebra Imports
    Expenses:Food                           7.00 EUR
    Assets:Cash
end test

test xact 2024/03/01 Zebra Expenses:Food
2024/03/01 Zebra Imports
    Expenses:Food                          20.00 EUR
    Assets:Cash
end test
